'''Charmander''' (Japanese: '''ヒトカゲ''' ''Hitokage'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

