==Release information==
The {{TCGP|Promo-A}} card was available via special wonder picks during the [[Wonder Pick Event (Blastoise)|Blastoise Wonder Pick Event]], though the wonder picks were offset by 24 hours compared to the event; it was therefore available from January 7 to 21, 2025, while the event itself ran from January 8 to 22.

